// Permit Transfer when the user previously made a Transfer of exactly
// decimal("2.50") that resolved (any output). The decimal literal filter
// on an input field means only that specific amount satisfies the body.
// At a Read timepoint the Transfer scope prevents this from being a
// determining policy even though the resolved predicate body is still satisfied.
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Transfer",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h Drupe::Action::"Transfer"::response{ input.user: context.input.user, input.amount: decimal("2.50") }
};
